# RCLK_CLEM_CLKBUF_L: the HROUTE buffers at X15 and X22 on the K26.
#
# A tile type the ZU3EG does not have, so prjuray-db has nothing for it.
# Solved from designs/kv260_clk_char (56 specimens, 448 tile instances):
# every set bit in every instance is explained, and all 24 tracks follow
#   PIP.CLK_HROUTE_R<k>.CLK_HROUTE_L<k>.FWD  13_(46-2k) 13_(47-2k)
#   WIRE.CLK_HROUTE_L<k>.USED                12_(46-2k)
# Vivado's kv260_bram_rom reference agrees (track 8: 12_30 13_30 13_31).
# FWD only: every clock here enters from the PS at the west edge.
RCLK_CLEM_CLKBUF_L.PIP.CLK_HROUTE_R0.CLK_HROUTE_L0.FWD add-feature 13_46 13_47
RCLK_CLEM_CLKBUF_L.WIRE.CLK_HROUTE_L0.USED.V1 add-feature 12_46
